{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44730","headline":"送明素上人归楚觐省 · 灵一","name":"送明素上人归楚觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能将疎懒背时人，不厌孤萍任此身。\n江上昔年同出处，天涯今日共风尘。\n平湖旧隐应残雪，芳草归心未隔春。\n前路倍怜多胜事，到家知庆彩衣新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}